DESCRIPTION:BOX OFFICE: 6:00 DOORS: 7:00 All Ages Welcome This is a cashles
	s venue A message from The Music of Hey Arnold! Live!: We are supporters o
	f the Jazz Foundation of America (JFA)\, a national nonprofit providing co
	mpassionate and personalized support to jazz\, blues\, and roots musicians
	 in need\, as a result of age\, illness or circumstances. JFA provides eme
	rgency financial support\, housing and medical assistance\, disaster relie
	f and more. They also create meaningful work opportunities for musicians\,
	 by bringing live music into schools\, senior centers\, and creating hundr
	eds of free-to-the public concerts. If you are able\, we ask that you cons
	ider a donation to the Jazz Foundation of America\, and help support the 2
	\,000+ musicians they currently serve. We thank you for supporting us and 
	for supporting this organization that honors jazz\, blues and roots music\
	, by caring for those who create it. We hope you enjoy the show!\nBOX OFFI
	CE: 6:00 DOORS: 7:00 All Ages Welcome This is a cashless venue A message f
	rom The Music of Hey Arnold! Live!: We are supporters of the Jazz Foundati
	on of America (JFA)\, a national nonprofit providing compassionate and per
	sonalized support to jazz\, blues\, and roots musicians in need\, as a res
	ult of age\, illness or circumstances. JFA provides emergency financial su
	pport\, housing and medical assistance\, disaster relief and more. They al
	so create meaningful work opportunities for musicians\, by bringing live m
	usic into schools\, senior centers\, and creating hundreds of free-to-the 
	public concerts. If you are able\, we ask that you consider a donation to 
	the Jazz Foundation of America\, and help support the 2\,000+ musicians th
	ey currently serve. We thank you for supporting us and for supporting this
	 organization that honors jazz\, blues and roots music\, by caring for tho
	se who create it. We hope you enjoy the show!\n\nhttps://www.ticketmaster.
